fices she made for their family—forcing them to navigate co-parenting, identity, and whether love can take a new form.\\n\\nBradley Cooper's third behind-the-camera venture after A Star is Born and Maestro.\\n\\n★★★★★ - The Times\\n★★★★ - Daily Telegraph\\n★★★★ - Guardian\",\"starring\":\"Will Arnett, Laura Dern, Andra Day\",\"directedBy\":\"Bradley Cooper\",\"producedBy\":\"Bradley Cooper, Will Arnett, Kris Thykier, Weston Middleton\",\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":121,\"genre\":\"Comedy\",\"allGenres\":\"Comedy, Drama\",\"rating\":\"15\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"ngmu5zGOa7s\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-30\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-01-30\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":3.1212,\"tmdbId\":\"1140498\",\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"480188\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Is This Thing On? [15]\",\"siteId\":\"93\",\"titleClassId\":\"110\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"390092\",\"time\":\"2026-01-30T14:45:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":1,\"screenId\":\"141\",\"seatsRemaining\":59,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"sc2\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"390093\",\"time\":\"2026-01-30T20:10:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":4,\"screenId\":\"141\",\"seatsRemaining\":56,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"sc2\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"390104\",\"time\":\"2026-01-31T12:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"141\",\"seatsRemaining\":60,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"sc2\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"390108\",\"time\":\"2026-01-31T17:25:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":5,\"screenId\":\"141\",\"seatsRemaining\":55,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"sc2\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"390112\",\"time\":\"2026-02-01T12:10:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"141\",\"seatsRemaining\":60,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"sc2\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"390113\",\"time\":\"2026-02-01T20:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":2,\"screenId\":\"141\",\"seatsRemaining\":58,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"sc2\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"390120\",\"time\":\"2026-02-02T14:50:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":1,\"screenId\":\"141\",\"seatsRemaining\":59,\"displa